---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import Headline from '../../components/Headline.astro';
import Button from '../../components/Button.astro';
import Tbd from '../../components/Tbd.astro';
import { site } from '../../config/site';
import { u } from '../../lib/url';
const { am, pm } = site.formulas;
const un = site.unknowns;
---
<Base title="FAQ" description="Answers about the routine, what is inside, and preorders." tone="paper">
  <!-- REVIEW: regulatory review required -->
  <section class="section section--l" style="padding-bottom:var(--pad-s)">
    <div class="wrap">
      <Headline as="h1" size="h1">Questions, <em>answered.</em></Headline>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--s" style="padding-top:0">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="grp">
        <h2 class="display display--h3 grp__t">The routine</h2>
        <div class="grp__items">
          <details open><summary>What is it?</summary>
            <div class="ans prose"><p>{site.brand.name} is a creatine monohydrate routine in two single-serve sticks: one for the morning and one for the evening. Creatine monohydrate supports muscle when taken every day, so the sticks sit on moments that already happen.</p></div></details>
          <details><summary>When do I take each stick?</summary>
            <div class="ans prose"><p>Take the morning stick with breakfast and the evening stick later in the day.</p></div></details>
          <details><summary>What if I miss one?</summary>
            <!-- REVIEW: confirm missed-dose guidance -->
            <div class="ans prose"><p>Take the next one as normal. Don't double up.</p></div></details>
          <details><summary>How do I take it?</summary>
            <div class="ans prose"><p>Tear the stick open into a glass of water and stir.</p></div></details>
          <details><summary>What do they taste like?</summary>
            <div class="ans prose"><p>Morning stick: <Tbd value={am.flavor} />. Evening stick: <Tbd value={pm.flavor} />.</p></div></details>
          <details><summary>How many sticks are in a pack?</summary>
            <div class="ans prose"><p>Sticks per pack: <Tbd value={un.sticksPerPack} />.</p></div></details>
          <details><summary>What color is the packaging?</summary>
            <div class="ans prose"><p>Packaging colors: <Tbd value={un.packagingColors} />.</p></div></details>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="grp">
        <h2 class="display display--h3 grp__t">What's inside</h2>
        <div class="grp__items">
          <details><summary>What's in the morning stick?</summary>
            <div class="ans prose"><p>Creatine monohydrate (<Tbd value={am.ingredients[0].dose} />) and L-theanine (<Tbd value={am.ingredients[1].dose} />). Flavor: <Tbd value={am.flavor} />. The full label is on the <a href={u("/science/")}>science page</a>.</p></div></details>
          <details><summary>What's in the evening stick?</summary>
            <div class="ans prose"><p>Creatine monohydrate (<Tbd value={pm.ingredients[0].dose} />) and magnesium bisglycinate (<Tbd value={pm.ingredients[1].dose} />). Flavor: <Tbd value={pm.flavor} />.</p></div></details>
          <details><summary>What about the magnesium?</summary>
            <div class="ans prose"><p>The evening stick provides magnesium bisglycinate, <Tbd value={pm.ingredients[1].dose} />. Magnesium supports muscle and nerve function.</p></div></details>
          <details><summary>Is it tested?</summary>
            <div class="ans prose"><p>Lab partner: <Tbd value={un.labPartner} />. What is tested: <Tbd value={un.tested} />. We plan to publish test reports by lot number on the science page.</p></div></details>
          <details><summary>Who should talk to a doctor first?</summary>
            <div class="ans prose"><p>Talk to your doctor before use if you are pregnant or nursing, have a medical condition, or take medication.</p></div></details>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="grp">
        <h2 class="display display--h3 grp__t">Preorders and refills</h2>
        <div class="grp__items">
          <details><summary>When will my preorder ship?</summary>
            <div class="ans prose"><p>Preorders aren't open yet. Estimated ship date: <Tbd value={un.shipDate} />.</p></div></details>
          <details><summary>When am I charged?</summary>
            <div class="ans prose"><p>You are not charged. Preorders aren't open. Charge timing, once they are: <Tbd value={un.chargeTiming} />.</p></div></details>
          <details><summary>How do refills work?</summary>
            <div class="ans prose"><p>Refills aren't on sale yet. Sticks per pack: <Tbd value={un.sticksPerPack} />. Skip and cancel terms: <Tbd value={un.skipCancel} />.</p></div></details>
          <details><summary>Where do you ship?</summary>
            <div class="ans prose"><p><Tbd value={un.shippingRegions} /></p></div></details>
          <details><summary>Returns</summary>
            <div class="ans prose"><p><Tbd value={un.returnPolicy} /></p></div></details>
          <details><summary>How do I get help?</summary>
            <div class="ans prose"><p>Email <a href={`mailto:${site.legal.email}`}>{site.legal.email}</a>.</p></div></details>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="more">
        <div>
          <h2 class="display display--h3">Still have a question?</h2>
          <p class="prose" style="margin-top:0.8em">Email <a href={`mailto:${site.legal.email}`}>{site.legal.email}</a>.</p>
        </div>
        <Button href="/product/">Preorders aren't open yet</Button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .grp { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: clamp(20px, 4vw, 80px); border-top: 1px solid var(--ink); padding-block: clamp(28px, 4vw, 56px) clamp(40px, 6vw, 96px); }
  .grp__t { flex: 4 1 260px; align-self: flex-start; }
  @media (min-width: 900px) { .grp__t { position: sticky; top: 96px; } }
  .grp__items { flex: 7 1 340px; min-width: 0; }
  details { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line-paper); }
  details:first-child { border-top: 1px solid var(--line-paper); }
  summary {
    list-style: none; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 16px;
    min-height: 56px; padding-block: 12px; font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer;
  }
  summary::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }
  summary::after, summary::before { content: ''; position: absolute; right: 0; top: 50%; width: 14px; height: 1.5px; background: currentColor; }
  summary::after { transform: translateY(-50%) rotate(90deg); transition: transform 120ms var(--ease-standard); }
  summary::before { transform: translateY(-50%); }
  summary { position: relative; padding-right: 32px; }
  details[open] > summary::after { transform: translateY(-50%) rotate(0); }
  .ans { padding-bottom: 24px; }
  .more { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: flex-end; justify-content: space-between; gap: 24px; border-top: 1px solid var(--ink); padding-top: clamp(28px, 4vw, 56px); }
</style>
